dow.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b[18;44H  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the overlay rendered rather than merely dropping the event.\u001b[38;44H\u001b[38;5;239m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39;44H\u001b[38;5;147m❯\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[40;44H\u001b[38;5;239m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[41;44H\u001b[38;5;244m  ⏵⏵ normal mode · shift+tab to cycle · ← for agents\u001b[1;42r\u001b[41;96H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
