44H  3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when action.forwarded_input is set;\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[19;44H  empty means nothing reaches tmux. The overlay is painted client-side via\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[9X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[20;44H  surface.paint_overlays.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[58X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[21;44H  4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[22;44H  mode; the implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane would enter copy-mode,\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[23;44H  which is deliberately avoided.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[51X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[24;44H  Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[25;44H  immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[26;44H  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[6X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[27;44H  overlay rendered r"]
