[12.671315, "o", "\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[30m\u001b[1m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\u001b[30m\u001b[1m\r\nF8 layout · F9 fullscreen\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[17X\u001b[30m\u001b[1m\r\nC-b Tab Sidebar · C-b ← Pane 1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[12X\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1m\r\n?\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Help\u001b[49m\u001b[30m\u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236mq\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Quit\u001b[49m\u001b[30m\u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236mC-b d\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Detach\u001b[49m\u001b[30m\u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m+\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m More\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[9X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1;44H ▐▛███▜▌   Claude Code v2.1.220\u001b[39m\u001b[52X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[2;44H▝▜█████▛▘  Opus 5 (1M context) · API Usage Billing\u001b[39m\u001b[33X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[3;44H  ▘▘ ▝▝    /demo/railmux-web-workspace-v1/projects/railmux\u001b[39m\u001b[25X\u001b[4;44H\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;147m\n❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252mIn railmux ssh, explain how a mouse-wheel event over an agent pane is served\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[6;44H  from the fast client's local history overlay rather than forwarded upstream.\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[7;44H  Point to the exact implementation symbols and one existing focused test that\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[8;44H  directly asserts empty forwarded_input. Then suggest one small additional\u001b[39m\u001b[8X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[9;44H  assertion.\u001b[39m\u001b[71X\u001b[10;44H\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;147m\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1mTrace SSH wheel ownership\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[56X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[12;44H  railmux ssh — agent-pane wheel served locally, not forwarded upstream:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[11X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[13;44H  1. handle_terminal_part gets the SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[17X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[14;44H  LocalHistoryView.wheel.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[58X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[15;44H  2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent viewport scrolls\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[16;44H  _HistoryViewport.offset and returns HistoryAction with render_history=True and\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[17;44H  forwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream input.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[41X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[18;44H  3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when action.forwarded_input is set;\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[19;44H  empty means nothing reaches tmux. The overlay is painted client-side via\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[9X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[20;44H  surface.paint_overlays.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[58X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[21;44H  4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[22;44H  mode; the implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane would enter copy-mode,\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[23;44H  which is deliberately avoided.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[51X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[24;44H  Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[25;44H  immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[26;44H  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[6X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[27;44H  overlay rendered rather than merely dropping the event.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[26X\u001b[28;44H\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\n\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[1m\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;147m\u001b[1m\u001b[39;44H❯\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[81X\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[40;44H──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[41;44H  ⏵⏵ normal mode · shift+tab to cycle · ← for agents\u001b[39m\u001b[31X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1;128H╭───────────────────────────────────────────�"]
[12.671828, "o", "��────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[2;128H│ \u001b[1m>_ OpenAI Codex (v0.145.0)                                                   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m│\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[3;128H│ model: gpt-5.3-codex                                                        │\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[4;128H│ directory: /demo/railmux-web-workspace-v1/projects/railmux                    │\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[5;128H╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[6;128H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;75m\n•\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1mExplain workspace layout\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[8;128H  F8 uses `next_workspace_layout()` to cycle `WorkspaceLayout.SINGLE →\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[9;128H  SIDE_BY_SIDE → STACKED → SINGLE`.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[10;128H  `WorkspacePresentation.COMPACT` preserves `AgentWorkspace.layout` but shows one\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[11;128H  full-window `WorkspacePage` at a time via `AgentWorkspace.compact_page`.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[12;128H  Page switching only changes presentation, while `collapse_to_primary()` hides\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[13;128H  the secondary outer pane and preserves its detached agent identity in\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[14;128H  `AgentWorkspace.collapsed_secondary_agent`, so the agent keeps running.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[15;128H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\n› Ask Codex to do anything\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[1m\u001b[40;128H  ? for shortcuts\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[41;128H\u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[48;5;70m\r\n Railmux · Codex · ◨                                                                                                                               Soft Quit (q, then s) closes shared views; agents keep running \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[40;145H"]
